## Complete Full-Stack Resource Sharing and Laboratory Management Platform
### CodeVerse India 2026 Hackathon

## YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, software architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, security specialist and QA engineer.

Your task is to develop a complete, professional, interactive, responsive and functional web application called *CampusShare*.

The application must be a working product, not merely a landing page, static dashboard, UI mockup or collection of disconnected screens.

You must implement the frontend, backend, database, authentication, resource management, laboratory management, equipment inventory, booking workflows, instructor dashboard, fair-allocation mechanism, condition reporting, incident management, audit logs and analytics.

Work directly in the currently opened repository. Inspect existing files before modifying them. Preserve useful existing code and adapt the implementation to the current project structure where practical.

